TIP:  The Woo-hoo is the yodeling part.  It really doesn’t matter what you sing.  Capo 1 to sing with Eddy in his earlier recordings, Capo 2 to sing with Dwight, and unfortunately the very pretty Arnold/Rimes duet has each singing in a different key which really messes up the chords.  The inflection and cadence here is from the Yoakum recording.

      
